OL,3,GNEWSAMother hailed for inspirational
OL,4,Afirst aid training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who had to give up her
OL,7,Fparamedic career when her daughter was
OL,8,Fborn said being a volunteer with  St
OL,9,FJohn's Ambulance Service for 60 years
OL,10,Fallowed her to stay involved with first
OL,11,Faid.
OL,13,FViv Moore, from Nuneaton, started
OL,14,Fvolunteering with the service when her
OL,15,Fdaughter was nine years old and spent
OL,16,Fnearly six decades working for the
OL,17,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
