OL,3,GNEWSAMother hailed for inspirational
OL,4,Afirst aid training
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the years, she said she had
OL,7,Ftrained a lot of young people in first
OL,8,Faid, attended events as an emergency
OL,9,Fresponder and even funded a
OL,10,Fdefibrillator for her local area.
OL,12,F"There have been a few times where you
OL,13,Fthink, 'well actually do I want to go',
OL,14,Fbut then you look at the effects that
OL,15,Fyou have on the young people,"Moore
OL,16,Ftold BBC CWR.
